[
  {
    "content_id": "10056001001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提多书 1:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "56001001",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;神的仆人，耶稣基督的使徒保罗，凭着　神选民的信心与敬虔真理的知识，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10056001002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提多书 1:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "56001002",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;盼望那无谎言的　神在万古之先所应许的永生，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10056001003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提多书 1:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "56001003",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;到了日期，借着传扬的工夫把他的道显明了；这传扬的责任是按着　神—我们救主的命令交托了我。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10056001004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提多书 1:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "56001004",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;现在写信给提多，就是照着我们共信之道作我真儿子的。愿恩惠、平安从父　神和我们的救主基督耶稣归与你！</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10056001005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提多书 1:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "56001005",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;我从前留你在克里特，是要你将那没有办完的事都办整齐了，又照我所吩咐你的，在各城设立长老。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10056001006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提多书 1:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "56001006",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;若有无可指责的人，只作一个妇人的丈夫，儿女也是信主的，没有人告他们是放荡不服约束的，就可以设立。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10056001007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提多书 1:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "56001007",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;监督既是　神的管家，必须无可指责，不任性，不暴躁，不因酒滋事，不打人，不贪无义之财；</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10056001008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提多书 1:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "56001008",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;乐意接待远人，好善，庄重，公平，圣洁自持；</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10056001009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提多书 1:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "56001009",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;坚守所教真实的道理，就能将纯正的教训劝化人，又能把争辩的人驳倒了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10056001010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提多书 1:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "56001010",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;因为有许多人不服约束，说虚空话欺哄人；那奉割礼的更是这样。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10056001011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提多书 1:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "56001011",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;这些人的口总要堵住。他们因贪不义之财，将不该教导的教导人，败坏人的全家。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10056001012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提多书 1:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "56001012",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;有克里特人中的一个本地先知说：「克里特人常说谎话，乃是恶兽，又馋又懒。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10056001013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提多书 1:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "56001013",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;这个见证是真的。所以，你要严严地责备他们，使他们在真道上纯全无疵，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10056001014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提多书 1:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "56001014",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;不听犹太人荒谬的言语和离弃真道之人的诫命。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10056001015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提多书 1:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "56001015",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;在洁净的人，凡物都洁净；在污秽不信的人，什么都不洁净，连心地和天良也都污秽了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10056001016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提多书 1:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "56001016",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;他们说是认识　神，行事却和他相背；本是可憎恶的，是悖逆的，在各样善事上是可废弃的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10056002001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提多书 2:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "56002001",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;但你所讲的总要合乎那纯正的道理。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10056002002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提多书 2:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "56002002",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;劝老年人要有节制、端庄、自守，在信心、爱心、忍耐上都要纯全无疵。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10056002003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提多书 2:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "56002003",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;又劝老年妇人，举止行动要恭敬，不说谗言，不给酒作奴仆，用善道教训人，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10056002004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提多书 2:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "56002004",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;好指教少年妇人，爱丈夫，爱儿女，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10056002005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提多书 2:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "56002005",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;谨守，贞洁，料理家务，待人有恩，顺服自己的丈夫，免得　神的道理被毁谤。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10056002006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提多书 2:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "56002006",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;又劝少年人要谨守。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10056002007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提多书 2:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "56002007",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;你自己凡事要显出善行的榜样；在教训上要正直、端庄，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10056002008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提多书 2:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "56002008",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;言语纯全，无可指责，叫那反对的人，既无处可说我们的不是，便自觉羞愧。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10056002009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提多书 2:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "56002009",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;劝仆人要顺服自己的主人，凡事讨他的喜欢，不可顶撞他，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10056002010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提多书 2:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "56002010",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;不可私拿东西，要显为忠诚，以致凡事尊荣我们救主—　神的道。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10056002011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提多书 2:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "56002011",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;因为　神救众人的恩典已经显明出来，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10056002012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提多书 2:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "56002012",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;教训我们除去不敬虔的心和世俗的情欲，在今世自守、公义、敬虔度日，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10056002013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提多书 2:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "56002013",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;等候所盼望的福，并等候至大的　神和我们救主耶稣基督的荣耀显现。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10056002014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提多书 2:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "56002014",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;他为我们舍了自己，要赎我们脱离一切罪恶，又洁净我们，特作自己的子民，热心为善。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10056002015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提多书 2:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "56002015",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;这些事你要讲明，劝戒人，用各等权柄责备人；不可叫人轻看你。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10056003001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提多书 3:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "56003001",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;你要提醒众人，叫他们顺服作官的、掌权的，遵他的命，预备行各样的善事。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10056003002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提多书 3:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "56003002",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;不要毁谤，不要争竞，总要和平，向众人大显温柔。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10056003003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提多书 3:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "56003003",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;我们从前也是无知、悖逆、受迷惑、服事各样私欲，和宴乐，常存恶毒嫉妒的心，是可恨的，又是彼此相恨。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10056003004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提多书 3:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "56003004",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;但到了　神—我们救主的恩慈和他向人所施的慈爱显明的时候，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10056003005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提多书 3:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "56003005",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;他便救了我们；并不是因我们自己所行的义，乃是照他的怜悯，借着重生的洗和圣灵的更新。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10056003006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提多书 3:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "56003006",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;圣灵就是　神借着耶稣基督—我们救主厚厚浇灌在我们身上的，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10056003007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提多书 3:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "56003007",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;好叫我们因他的恩得称为义，可以凭着永生的盼望成为后嗣。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10056003008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提多书 3:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "56003008",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;这话是可信的。我也愿你把这些事切切实实地讲明，使那些已信　神的人留心做正经事业。这都是美事，并且与人有益。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10056003009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提多书 3:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "56003009",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;要远避无知的辩论和家谱的空谈，以及纷争，并因律法而起的争竞，因为这都是虚妄无益的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10056003010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提多书 3:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "56003010",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;分门结党的人，警戒过一两次，就要弃绝他。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10056003011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提多书 3:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "56003011",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;因为知道这等人已经背道，犯了罪，自己明知不是，还是去做。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10056003012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提多书 3:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "56003012",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;我打发亚提马或是推基古到你那里去的时候，你要赶紧往尼哥坡里去见我，因为我已经定意在那里过冬。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10056003013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提多书 3:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "56003013",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;你要赶紧给律师西纳和亚波罗送行，叫他们没有缺乏。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10056003014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提多书 3:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "56003014",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;并且我们的人要学习正经事业，预备所需用的，免得不结果子。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10056003015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提多书 3:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "56003015",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;同我在一处的人都问你安。请代问那些因有信心爱我们的人安。愿恩惠常与你们众人同在！</p>"
  }
]